<title>HONG KONG: H.K. dlr Oct M-3 rises 14.8 pct on year.</title>
<headline>H.K. dlr Oct M-3 rises 14.8 pct on year.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hong Kong Monetary Authority gave the following money supply figures as percentage changes:</p>
<p>					Oct '96    Sept '96    Oct '95</p>
<p> HK dollar M-3 (year-on-year)  +14.8	 +13.6	 +18.2</p>
<p> HK dollar M-3 (month)	   +2.6	  +1.8	  +1.6</p>
<p>					Oct '96    Sept '96    Oct '95</p>
<p> HK dollar M-1 (year-on-year)  +10.2	+12.2	  +0.5</p>
<p> HK dollar M-1 (month)	    +0.9	 +5.9	  +2.8</p>
<p> HK dollar M-2 (year-on-year)  +15.0	+13.9	 +18.4</p>
<p> HK dollar M-2 (month)	    +2.6	 +1.8	  +1.6</p>
<p>Loans to finance visible trade of Hong Kong (year-on-Year)</p>
<p>					  +5.3	 +5.6	 +21.7</p>
<p>Other loans for use in Hong Kong (year-on-year)</p>
<p>					 +14.6	+14.4	 +11.7</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
